 "remarks": "Stunning waterfront setting where expansive views, timeless architecture and an effortless sense of escape come together. Set along the shoreline in Shorefront Park, this classic Colonial offers a front-row seat to the water, its own sandy beach and a welcoming waterfront community. Inside, the bright main level is designed for easy living and entertaining, with a spacious kitchen opening to an expansive waterfront deck, living room with fireplace, dining area, home office or den, powder room and attached two-car garage. Upstairs, the primary suite captures sweeping water views and features a private balcony, fireplace and beautiful bath with soaking tub and oversized walk-in shower. Three additional bedrooms a full bath and laundry room complete the second floor. The third-floor bonus space offers panoramic views, a Juliet balcony and half bath perfect for an office, gym, studio, media room or private retreat. Outside, a lush lawn leads to your sandy beach for swimming, kayaking, paddle boarding or simply unwinding by the water. Shorefront Park's two community beaches and social neighborhood atmosphere add to the lifestyle, while downtown SoNo's restaurants, shops, train station and waterfront scene are just minutes away. Here, the water sets the pace and every day feels a little more like a getaway.",
